   "text": "50,000 requests over an 8-hour day ≈ 104 per minute\n× (20,000 input + 5 × 1,000 output) ≈ 2.6M TPM on average\nplan 2–3× for peaks, and keep max_tokens tight",
   "originalText": "50,000 requests over an 8-hour day ≈ 104 per minute\n× (20,000 input + 5 × 1,000 output) ≈ 2.6M TPM on average\nplan 2–3× for peaks, and keep max_tokens tight",
