   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cheaper option: Sonnet 5.5 at $2 / $10 is ≈ $2,500 a day uncached, but in Sydney it's on global. only (at launch), so processing can leave Australia.\nEvery number here is an assumption you can swap: tokens × price for the bill, (input + 5 × output) per minute for the quota.",
